-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 3.3.1999 — שינוי שיטת הפנסיה מפנסיה תקציבית לפנסיה
-- צוברת: the public employers (the State, the local authorities, the three
-- large cities, the Hebrew University, the Technion, the regional
-- councils, the religious councils, the National Insurance Institute, the
-- Employment Service and the fire-service associations) and the New
-- General Histadrut move the groups of employees who could join the
-- budgetary-pension track to an accrual pension, and bring further salary
-- components into the accrual pension. General (chapter א'); definitions —
-- employee, permanent, existing and new employee for each employer, the
-- determining date, the fund, the pension law, an expense reimbursement and
-- the kinds of accrual fund (ב'); whom it covers (ג'); the permanent
-- employee, who stays on the budgetary pension and has accrual
-- contributions on his other components, or the alternative arrangement
-- (ד'); the existing and the new employee, in an accrual fund or managers'
-- insurance (ה'); their contribution base (ו'); the rates, 12% and 5.5%,
-- and the local authorities' retroactive completion (ז'); severance, 72%
-- and 28% (ח'); money back to the employer (ט'); choosing the fund (י');
-- the cost, 2.1% (יא'); legislation (יב'); equal terms with another union's
-- agreement (יג'); earlier terms, the background, disputes, commencement,
-- exhaustion and registration (יד'–יט'). Annexed: the workplaces of
-- friction (א'–ב'), the completeness arrangement with the pension funds
-- (ג'), the purchase of rights back in time (ד'), the bill amending the
-- Pensions Law (ה'), and four letters and agreements of 1999.
--
-- It covers no teaching employee: chapter ג' §1(ב) leaves out the teaching
-- scale represented by הסתדרות המורים or by ארגון המורים. The framework
-- agreement of 12.1.2011, annex ג' (2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011),
-- amends it and imports it. It speaks to no pay item of
-- l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root. What it cites outside itself —
-- the Pensions Law and the other laws and regulations, the provident-fund
-- agreement of 10.8.95 (held by the corpus, not yet encoded), the
-- employers' own pension rules and continuity agreements — is a named input
-- where a rule needs it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT budget_foundations_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — שינוי שיטת הפנסיה מפנסיה תקציבית לפנסיה צוברת (3.3.1999)`

DECLARE `1999 transition action` IS ONE OF
    `publish the determining date under the Pensions Law`
    `sign the completeness agreement with the pension funds`
    `discuss returning the employer's share on a component the budgetary pension pays`
    `notify the employer of the chosen pension funds`
    `support the steps the transition agreement needs`
    `act to advance the bill amending the Pensions Law`
    `decide disputes over the transition agreement`
    `submit the transition agreement for registration`
    `negotiate another arrangement for the rest of the year`
    `approve a request to widen the insured base`
    `sign an agreement widening the insured base`
    `allocate the posts for converting monthly employment`
    `fill the allocated posts`
    `publish a tender for an allocated post`

`why the provident-fund agreement of 10.8.95 is not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "הסכם קיבוצי — הפרשה לקופת גמל בגין רכיבי שכר ותשלומים אחרים שאינם פנסיוניים, מיום 10.8.95 (\"הסכם הגמל\")"

`why the laws and regulations it cites are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות) [נוסח משולב], התש\"ל-1970; חוק שירות המדינה (מינויים), התשי\"ט-1959; חוק פיצויי פיטורים, התשכ\"ג-1963, סעיף 14; תקנות מס הכנסה (כללים לאישור ולניהול קופות גמל), התשכ\"ד-1964"

`why the employers' own pension rules are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוקת העבודה לעובדי הרשויות המקומיות (סעיף 79), החלטות מועצות העיריות, ההסכם הקיבוצי בירושלים מיום 15.3.73, חוק שירותי הדת היהודיים וההסכם משנת 1975, הסכם הפנסיה התקציבית באוניברסיטה העברית, חוקת הגמלאות בטכניון מיום 26.11.65, וההסכמים בדבר רציפות זכויות"

