-- corpus dates it 3.3.1999, the day of the wages commissioner's letter and
-- notice it cites (chapter ג' §3(ב), chapter ט"ו). F-pension-1999-a: the
-- agreement of the Centre of Local Government annexed to it (annex י')
-- names it "מיום 3.4.99". The reading adopted (convention reading.misprint):
-- 3.3.1999, as the corpus dates it.
