-- the eve of the signing, and further components are brought into the
-- accrual pension.
@ref akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18
`the 1999 agreement moves the budgetary track to an accrual pension` MEANS TRUE

§§ `פרק א' — כללי`

-- akn:chp_1 The heading of chapter א'.

