-- here what convention precedence.heading answers where a text is silent).
-- §3: the masculine includes the feminine, the singular the plural.
@ref akn:chp_1__art_1
`the 1999 agreement's preamble and annexes are part of it` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1__art_2
`the 1999 agreement's headings bear on its reading` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1__art_3
