-- The wages unit's letter of 10.9.98 (ג2), asking the capital-market
-- department not to object to: (1)(א) for employees who do not accrue the
-- share of the average wage the fund's rules need to pay a pension, a
-- completeness arrangement between the new fund and the body that pays
-- budgetary pensions; (ב) the fund transfers the pensions and the list of
-- pensioners to that body, which pays them at the budgetary pension's dates
-- and outside it; (ג) they are entitled to a pension by it all the same;
-- (2)(א) no financial duty on the paying body; (ב) the funds bear the cost,
