-- akn:att_6__hc_1/p6 Its year, 5759-1999; no rule.
-- akn:att_6__hc_1/p7 The heading "amendment of section 1"; no rule.
-- akn:att_6__hc_1__para_2 The number of the bill's second section; its text follows.
-- akn:att_6__hc_1__para_2/p2 The heading "adding a schedule"; no rule.

-- The bill (a proposal; chapter י"ב puts the government to advancing it):
-- §1 defines "היום הקובע" (the day the Finance Minister sets under §107א(ג))
-- and leaves a new employee out of "a state employee". §107א: (א) the
-- Pensions Law does not apply to one appointed from his determining day;
-- (ב) he is insured in a pension provident fund on the collective
-- agreement's terms — failing one, his contract's; failing both, in the
-- fund most new employees are in, unless he chooses another; (ג)(1) the
-- minister sets the day by notice, no earlier than the 1st of the month
-- after the amendment starts and no later than 6 months after; (2) days may
-- differ by kinds of employees, but are one for each workplace of the
-- schedule; (3) save as a collective agreement agrees, the day then no
-- later than the 1st of the month after two months from telling the
-- minister; (4) also for those whose terms are a state employee's by law.
-- §107ב: not for one (א)–(ה) employed on the eve under a special contract,
-- a permit or a corporation's agreement who is appointed after the day, or
-- (ו) the security services, police and prison officers. §107ג: insuring
-- components outside the determining salary in a provident fund is by a
-- collective agreement or a contract the minister approves, and gives no
-- right under the Pensions Law. The schedule: the government hospitals,
-- ממ"ג and רפא"ל (annex א''s workplaces).
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_6__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1 akn:att_6__hc_1__para_1__subpara_2 akn:att_6__hc_1__para_2/p1 akn:att_6__hc_1__para_3
GIVEN `the month the amendment starts` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the earliest determining day under the bill` `the month the amendment starts` IS
    `the first of the month after` 0 `months after the month of` `the month the amendment starts`

GIVEN `the month the amendment starts` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the latest determining day under the bill` `the month the amendment starts` IS
    `the first of the month after` 5 `months after the month of` `the month the amendment starts`

`the bill's schedule` MEANS LIST "בתי חולים ממשלתיים", "ממ\"ג", "רפא\"ל"

-- The bill's schedule is annex א''s list of workplaces.
#ASSERT `the bill's schedule` EQUALS `the workplaces of annex א'`

-- §107ב(ד): one employed on the eve under a permit and appointed after the
-- day stays under the Pensions Law — the bill's answer for the one
-- F-pension-1999-b reads as permanent.
GIVEN `employed on the eve under a permit` IS A BOOLEAN, `appointed under §17 after the day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the bill keeps him under the Pensions Law` `employed on the eve under a permit` `appointed under §17 after the day` IF
    `employed on the eve under a permit` AND `appointed under §17 after the day`

§§ `מכתבים והסכם נלווים`

