-- The second letter: once the transition is carried out in full, the
-- commissioner will sign an agreement widening the base insured in an
-- accrual pension for State workplaces whose employees were always in one
-- (chapter ג' §2's), for the time from the transition within that tax year,
-- subject to the law, at a cost of 0.5% of the pension salary beyond the
-- wage agreements'.
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p12 akn:att_8__hc_1/p13 akn:att_8__hc_1/p14
`the cost of widening the base where employees were in an accrual pension` MEANS 0.5%

GIVEN `the transition is carried out in full` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1999 transition action`
DECIDE `widening the base where employees were in an accrual pension` `the transition is carried out in full` IS
    IF `the transition is carried out in full`
    THEN PARTY `the wages commissioner`
         MUST  `sign an agreement widening the insured base`
    ELSE FULFILLED

