-- The third letter, on new posts to turn monthly employment into standard
-- posts: (1)(א) the Civil Service Commission examines the jobs of
-- employees of kinds 02 and 71 for 5 straight years (breaks of up to 3
-- months not breaking it), the longest-serving first, and sets by the
-- service's needs which become posts; (ב) the State allocates 1,900 posts
-- for the Histadrut's scales: 665 at the determining date, no later than 3
-- months after the law comes into force, to the transition workplaces
-- only, not the friction workplaces; 665 the next January and 570 the
-- January after, keeping posts for the friction workplaces, on top of the
-- conversions already decided; (ג) employees are placed within a year of
-- the allocation, a tender published within 3 months. (2) the Institute's
-- posts follow the decision of 15.12.98, and the Histadrut's claims are
-- exhausted. (3) the Employment Service: the same rules; 35, 35 and 30
-- posts, 100 in all, at the State's dates, unconditioned, with the
-- Service's consent. Nothing in it changes the State's position that
-- organisation and posts are a managerial prerogative, not a matter for
-- collective negotiation.
@ref akn:att_9__hc_1/p12 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p3 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p4 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b__cls_3 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b__cls_3/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p3 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p3 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p4 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p5 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p6 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p7 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p9 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p10 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p11 akn:att_9__hc_1__para_3/p12
`the State's posts by allocation` MEANS LIST 665, 665, 570
`the State's posts in all` MEANS 1900
`the Employment Service's posts by allocation` MEANS LIST 35, 35, 30
`the Employment Service's posts in all` MEANS 100

#ASSERT sum `the State's posts by allocation` EQUALS `the State's posts in all`
#ASSERT sum `the Employment Service's posts by allocation` EQUALS `the Employment Service's posts in all`

GIVEN `years in kinds 02 or 71 without a break over 3 months` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a job the Commission examines for a post` `years in kinds 02 or 71 without a break over 3 months` IF
    `years in kinds 02 or 71 without a break over 3 months` AT LEAST 5

`allocating the posts` MEANS
    PARTY `the Civil Service Commission`
    MUST  `allocate the posts for converting monthly employment`
    HENCE (PARTY `the Civil Service Commission`
           MUST  `fill the allocated posts`
           WITHIN 365)

`publishing a tender for an allocated post` MEANS
    PARTY `the Civil Service Commission`
    MUST  `publish a tender for an allocated post`
    WITHIN 92

`organisation and posts are a matter for collective negotiation, in the State's position` MEANS FALSE

